  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3207.06 Transfer Validation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3207.06 Transfer Validation. Allowance transfers determined to be valid, through verification by the NATS administrator, shall be recorded in the NATS by deducting the specified allowances from the originating account and adding them to the acquiring account.\n\nSource. #11001, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14632, eff 6-25-26, EXPIRES: 6-25-36",
